tinacloud-auth-logout(1) -- Logout of a TinaCloud account
=========================================================

## DESCRIPTION

Logout from TinaCloud.

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud auth logout`

## EXAMPLES

Remove the locally cached TinaCloud credentials:

	$ tinacloud auth logout

